Modifications
-------------
The complete, machine-readable list of changes to upstream source is
`scripts/patches.mjs` (each entry carries its anchor and reason). In summary:

1. Host bridge
   Electron's preload globals (window.texpileNative, texpileTypst, texpileTerminal,
   texpileAcp, texpileAgent, texpileUpdates, texpileSnippets) are provided by
   `plugin/dsh-typwriter/src/browser/shim.js` over HTTP + SSE, so the renderer runs in an
   ordinary web page instead of Electron.

2. File scheme
   The `texfile://` custom protocol is replaced by the same-origin route
   `/typwriter/api/file?path=…`, served by `plugin/dsh-typwriter/src/host/static.js`.

3. Agent integration
   DeepSeek Harness is available as an Agent Client Protocol (ACP) agent
   (`plugin/dsh-typwriter/src/host/acp.js`); the agent conversation is shown in a
   right-hand pane (`lib/ai/agentPanel/ui/AgentPane.svelte`), and Refine runs a
   one-shot ACP session (`plugin/dsh-typwriter/src/host/rpc.js`).

4. Editor layout
   A three-column layout (`columns3`) was added to `lib/workspace/groups/layouts.ts`,
   with generalized track sizing; an empty editor pane can be closed from its corner.

5. Localisation and branding
   The default UI locale is zh-Hans; several hardcoded English UI strings were translated.
   The product name, wordmark (branding/Logo-*.svg), favicon and app icon were replaced
   with original artwork carrying the name Typwriter.

